OL,3,ADrumcree parade ban was in interests of
OL,4,Apeace, says Bryant
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland Secretary of State
OL,7,FSir Chris Bryant has said his decision
OL,8,Fto ban the Orange Order's Drumcree
OL,9,Fmarch was in the best interests of
OL,10,Fpeace.
OL,12,FHe announced the decision on Friday
OL,13,Fafter an agreement couldn't be reached
OL,14,Fbetween the Portadown District Lodge
OL,15,Fand the Garvaghy Road residents.
OL,17,FThe dispute led to a stand-off between
OL,18,FOrangemen and nationalist residents of
OL,19,Fthe Garvaghy Road in Portadown lasting
OL,20,Falmost two weeks.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
