OL,3,ADrumcree parade ban was in interests of
OL,4,Apeace, says Bryant
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Chris said he received advice from
OL,7,Fthe the PSNI chief constable that
OL,8,Fallowing the procession to go ahead
OL,9,Fcould lead to serious injury, disorder
OL,10,Fand wider unrest across Northern
OL,11,FIreland.
